        "old_string": "## Scripts\n\n- `bun run dev` - Run the main entry point\n- `bun test` - Run tests\n- `bun run lint` - Run linter\n- `bun run format` - Run formatter",
        "new_string": "## Scripts\n\n- `bun run dev` - Run the main entry point\n- `bun test` - Run tests\n- `bun run lint` - Run linter\n- `bun run format` - Run formatter\n- `bun run yaml-validate` - Validate YAML file syntax\n\n### YAML Validator\n\nValidate YAML files for syntax errors:\n\n```bash\n# Single file\nbun run yaml-validate config.yaml\n\n# Multiple files\nbun run yaml-validate config.yaml settings.yaml\n\n# From stdin\ncat config.yaml | bun run yaml-validate --stdin\n\n# Show help\nbun run yaml-validate --help\n```\n\n**Exit Codes** (for CI/CD integration):\n- `0` - All files validated successfully\n- `1` - One or more validation failures\n- `2` - Usage or argument error"
